:: Flats
<<set $outside to 0>><<location "flats">><<effects>>

당신은 바브 가에 있는 아파트 1층에 있다. 벽과 바닥은 평범하지만, 깨끗하게 잘 관리되어 있다. 복도를 따라 문들이 늘어서 있고, 끝에는 위로 올라가는 계단이 있다.
<br><br>

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
    아파트는 고요하다. 거주자들은 모두 잠든 모양이다.
    <br><br>
<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
    당신은 스스로의 <<nudity>> 상태를 의식하며 계단 아래에 숨었다.<<print _nudityExtra>>
    <br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
    <span class="red">당신은 한계를 넘었다.</span> 당신은 기절했다.
    <br><br>
    <<passout_flats>>
<<elseif $exposed lt 1 and currentSkillValue('housekeeping') gte 200 and $flats_superintendent is undefined>>

    <<generate1>><<generate2>><<person2>>
    문이 활짝 열리며, <<person>>【이가】 씩씩거리며 걸어 나온다. "씨발 나 안 해!" 뒤따라 나오는 <<person1>><<person>>【을를】 향해 가운뎃손가락을 날리며 <<he>>【이가】 말한다. <<person2>><<He>>【은는】 당신을 밀치듯 지나쳐 간다.
    <br><br>

    "그냥 제안해 본 거잖아." 당신 옆에 멈춰 서서 허벅지에 손을 짚은 채 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 말한다. "뭐, 또 한 명 나갔군." <<he>>【이가】 중얼거리곤 당신을 향해 고개를 돌린다. "당신 자주 보이던데. 아파트 사람들 잔심부름을 해준다고? 내가 이 아파트 관리인이야." <<he>>【은는】 손을 내민다.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[악수한다|Flats Superintendent Intro]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $flats_superintendent to 1>><<saveNPC 0 "flats_superintendent">><</link>><<handholdingvirginitywarning>>
    <br>
    <<link [[악수하지 않는다|Flats Superintendent Intro]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $flats_superintendent to 1>><<saveNPC 0 "flats_superintendent">><</link>>
    <br>

<<else>>

	<<if (dangerEvent() or $eventforced) and $eventskip is 0>>
		<<cleareventpool>>

		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			<<addinlineevent "flats_exposed_1" 1>>
				You hear voices up ahead. <<covered>> You turn, but hear voices from that direction as well. <span class="pink">You're trapped.</span>
				<br><br>

				There's an unlocked window to one side, and two doors to your right. You're not sure if they're locked.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Try a door|Flats Exposed Door]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Climb out the window|Flats Exposed Window]]>><</link>>
				<br>

			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_exposed_2" 1>>
				You come to an open door. You hear music, voices, and movement within. You peek around the corner. It looks like a party. It'll be hard to get by without anyone noticing, but perhaps if you're quick people will doubt they saw a thing.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Dash by|Flats Exposed Dash]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Find a way around (0:05)|Flats]]>><<stress 6>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<gstress>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_exposed_3" 1>>
				A pair of feet march down the stairs up ahead, catching you in the open. You crouch behind a large potted plant for cover.
				<br><br>

				<<generate1>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> steps into view, walking this way. You'll look odd crouched behind a plant.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Stay crouched|Flats Exposed Crouch]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Pick up the plant and walk with it|Flats Exposed Pick]]>><</link>><<difficulty 40>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent "flats_1" 1>>
				<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>><<person1>>
				A <<person>>, <<person2>><<person>>, and <<person3>><<person>> round a corner. You recognise them from school. They're delinquents.
				<br><br>
				<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
					<<if $whitneyromance is 1>>
						The <<person1>><<person>> steps in front of you. "What's Whitney's <<girl>> doing around here?" <<he>> asks.
						<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
							<<He>> pauses, considering, <span class="pink">then shoves you against the wall.</span> "It doesn't matter. You're in our territory. Get on your knees."<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<gpain>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<pain 4>>
							<br><br>

							<<link [[Get on your knees|Flats Events Knees]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
							<br>
							<<link [[Scream|Flats Events Scream]]>><<pain 4>><</link>><<gpain>>
							<br>
							<<link [[Fight|Flats Events Fight]]>><<def 1>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
							<br>
						<<else>>
							<<He>> pauses, considering, <span class="teal">then steps aside.</span>
							<br><br>

							They watch you walk away.
							<br><br>

							<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
							<br>
						<</if>>
					<<else>>
						The <<person1>><<person>> steps in front of you. "What's someone like you doing around here?" <<he>> asks, shoving you against the wall. <<His>> friends close in. "Get on your knees."<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<gpain>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<pain 4>>
						<br><br>

						<<link [[Get on your knees|Flats Events Knees]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
						<br>
						<<link [[Scream|Flats Events Scream]]>><<pain 4>><</link>><<gpain>>
						<br>
						<<link [[Fight|Flats Events Fight]]>><<def 1>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					The <<person1>><<person>> pulls a funny face, but they otherwise don't bother you.
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_2" 1>>
				<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
				<<generate2>><<person2>>
				A <<beasttype 0>> walks by, followed by a <<person2>><<person>> holding a lead. <<bHe 0>> stops to sniff you, but the <<person>> jerks <<bhim 0>> away.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_3" 1>>
				<<generate1>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> accosts you halfway in a stairwell, placing one arm around your waist, gripping your wrist with the other, and pulling you against <<him>>. "What a cute <<girl>>," <<he>> says, shifting your weight to keep you unsteady. <<He>> leans in to kiss.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Slap|Flats Events Slap]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 15000>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Stomp on foot|Flats Events Stomp]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 5000 13000>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Endure|Flats Events Endure]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<sub 1>><</link>><<difficulty 50>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_4" 1>>
				<<generate1>><<person1>>
				You pass a <<person>> working as a janitor. <<Hes>> wearing headphones, and doesn't seem to notice you.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<if $hookah_state is undefined>>
				<<addinlineevent "flats_5" 1>>
					The front door of one of the flats is ajar, and a purple light glows within. You smell a strange incense.<<garousal>><<arousal 600>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>>
					<br><br>
					<<link [[Investigate|Flats Hookah]]>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>><</link>>
					<br>
					<<link [[Ignore|Flats]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</addinlineevent>>
			<</if>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_6" 1>>
				<<generate1>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> leers openly as <<he>> walks by, turning <<his>> head to look behind <<him>>.
				<br><br>

				<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
					<i>Charging less will make <<him>> easier to convince.</i>
					<br><br>
					<<link [[Solicit for £50|Flats Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
					<br>
					<<link [[Solicit for £100|Flats Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
					<br>
					<<link [[Solicit for £150|Flats Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<insufficientStat "promiscuity" "to take advantage">>
					<br><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Ignore|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_7" 1>>
				<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> and <<person2>><<person>> chat under a stairwell. They lower their voices as you walk by.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_8" 1>>
				You hear shouting from one of the flats, but it doesn't sound like anyone's in danger.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_9" 1>>
				<<dancedifficulty 1 200 true>>
				<<if $danceSuccess>>
					You skid on a wet floor, spin, <span class="green">but manage to keep your footing.</span>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					You skid on a wet floor, <span class="red">and lose your footing.</span> You land on your <<bottom>>.<<gpain>><<pain 4>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "flats_10" 1>>
				A <<generate1>><<person1>><<person>> seems to be following you.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Ignore|Flats Events Ignore]]>><</link>><<difficulty 90>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Run|Flats Events Run]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<if Time.dayState is "night" and Time.isWeekEnd() and !$weekly.flatsCouple>>
				<<addinlineevent "flats_11" 1>>
					<<npc Bailey 1>><<generatep2>>
					<<if $bailey_partner is undefined>><<set $bailey_partner to 0>><</if>>
					<<set $weekly.flatsCouple to 1>>
					You hear giggles and clumsy footsteps from a nearby hallway. You suspect a couple returning from a <<print either("wild", "romantic")>> night.
					<<if $loveInterest.primary isnot "None">>
						The thought makes you smile, and your mind drifts to <<if $loveInterest.primary is "Black Wolf" or $loveInterest.primary is "Great Hawk">>the <</if>>$loveInterest.primary. You wish to share special nights like that with <<nnpc_him $loveInterest.primary>>, too.
					<</if>>
					<br><br>

					When you reach the end of the hallway, you come across the mysterious lovers. <span class="purple">It's Bailey</span>, <span class="lewd">kissing a <<person2>><<personsimple>> you don't recognise.</span>
					<br><br>

					<<if $rentTime lte 0>>
						You sneak away before Bailey notices you. You desperately try to erase the image from your mind. <<gtrauma>><<trauma 3>>
						<br><br>

						<<link [[Next|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						You hide behind a wall before being noticed. <<gstress>><<stress 3>>
						<br><br>

						<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
							<<link [[Take a look|Flats Events Peek]]>><</link>><<promiscuous3>><<gtrauma>>
							<br>
						<</if>>
						<<link [[Wait|Flats Events Hide]]>><</link>>
						<br>
						<<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</addinlineevent>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<runeventpool>>
	<<else>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
			<<dooricon>><<link [[Approach one of the flats (0:01)|Flats Lock]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $exposed lt 1>>
			<<if $flats_progress is undefined>>
				<<dooricon>><<link [[Knock on one of the flats (0:01)|Flats Knock Intro]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<dooricon>><<link [[Knock on a door (0:01)|Flats Knock]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $flats_window_init gte 2 and $exposed lt 1>>
			<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
				<span class="blue">You need more daylight to work as a window cleaner.</span>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
					<span class="red">Both of your arms are bound</span>, so you are unable to work as a window cleaner.
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Work as a window cleaner (1:00)|Flats Window]]>><<housekeeping 1 300>><</link>><<ghousekeeping 300>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $hookah_state gte 2>>
			<<dooricon "open">><<link [[Hookah Parlour (0:01)|Flats Hookah]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $exposed lt 1 and $hookah_state gte 1>>
			<<dooricon "open">><<link [[Hookah Parlour (0:20)|Flats Hookah]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $flats_superintendent is 1 or $flats_superintendent is 2>>
			<<if Time.dayState is "day">>
				<<if $exposed lt 1>>
					<<officeicon>><<link [[Superintendent's office (0:01)|Flats Superintendent]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if Time.dayState is "dawn">>
					<<officeicon>><span class="blue">The superintendent's office isn't open yet.</span>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<officeicon>><span class="blue">The superintendent's office is closed for the night.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<barbicon>><<link [[Leave|Barb Street]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

:: Flats Superintendent
<<effects>>

<<loadNPC 0 "flats_superintendent">><<person1>>
당신은 관리실에 들어갔다.
<<if $flats_superintendent is 2>>
    <<set $flats_superintendent to 3>>
    방은 비어 있다. 컵은 쓰러져 있고, 책상 위로 차가 엎질러져 있다. 바닥에는 코트가 떨어져 있다. 희미한 향 냄새가 공기 중에 맴돈다.
    <br><br>
<<else>>
    <<he>>【이가】 책상에 앉아 있는 것을 발견했다. <<he>>【이가】 고개를 든다.
    <br><br>
    "물담배 영업장을 찾는 데 진전은 있나?"
    <br><br>
    <<if $hookah_state gte 1>>
        <<if $hookah_state gte 2>>
            <<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[찾았다고 말하며 길을 안내한다 (0:01)|Flats Superintendent Found Quick]]>><<set $flats_superintendent to 2>><<pass 1>><</link>>
            <br>
        <<else>>
            <<icon "hookah-smoke.png">><<link [[찾았다고 말하며 길을 안내한다 (0:20)|Flats Superintendent Found]]>><<set $flats_superintendent to 2>><<pass 20>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
    <</if>>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Superintendent Intro
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	당신은 <<persons>> 손을 잡고 악수했다.
	<<takeHandholdingVirginity $NPCList[0] "consensual">>
<<else>>
    당신은 손을 옆에 가만히 두었다. <<person>>【은는】 대수롭지 않게 넘긴다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"저기," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "당신이 내 일을 좀 도와줄 수 있을 것 같은데. 몇몇 주민들이 거주자 한 명에 대해 불만을 제기했거든. 듣자하니 물담배 장사를 시작해서 건물 안을 연기로 가득 채우고 있다더군."
<br><br>
"이상한 건 말이야," <<he>>【이가】 머리를 긁적인다. "불만이 건물 곳곳에서 들어오고 있다는 거야. 말썽쟁이가 한둘이 아닐 수도 있는데, 도무지 찾아낼 수가 없군. 만약 당신이 그들을 발견하면 내게 알려줘. 그러면 수고비를 조금 주지."
<br><br>

<<if $hookah_state gte 1>>
	<<if $hookah_state gte 2>>
		<<link [[이미 찾았다고 말하며 길을 안내한다 (0:01)|Flats Superintendent Found Quick]]>><<set $flats_superintendent to 2>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[이미 찾았다고 말하며 길을 안내한다 (0:20)|Flats Superintendent Found]]>><<set $flats_superintendent to 2>><<pass 20>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[아무 말도 하지 않는다|Flats Superintendent Nod]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Flats Superintendent Found Quick
<<effects>>

"환상적이군," <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 말한다. "안내해!"
<br><br>

당신은 <<him>>【을를】 물담배 시음장으로 곧장 안내했다. "아," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이제 냄새가 나네. 사람들이 화낼 만도 하군." <<he>>【은는】 주위를 둘러본다. "이상하네. 아까 이 근처를 지나갔던 것 같은데, 이걸 못 보고 지나쳤다니 믿을 수가 없군."
<br><br>

<<he>>【은는】 으쓱한다. "어쨌든. 여기 수고비야." <<he>>【이가】 돈뭉치를 건네준다. 당신은 <<moneyGain 150>>【을를】 얻었다.
<br><br>

"주인장에게 인사를 좀 하러 가야겠군." <<he>>【이가】 걸어가며 말한다. "서류 작업을 마친 뒤에 말이야."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Superintendent Found
<<effects>>

"환상적이군," <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 말한다. "안내해!"
<br><br>

찾아내는 데 시간이 좀 걸렸지만, 당신이 장소를 찾을 때까지 <<he>>【은는】 참을성 있게 따라왔다. "아," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이제 냄새가 나네. 사람들이 화낼 만도 하군." <<he>>【은는】 주위를 둘러본다. "이상하네. 아까 이 근처를 지나갔던 것 같은데, 이걸 못 보고 지나쳤다니 믿을 수가 없군."
<br><br>

<<he>>【은는】 으쓱한다. "어쨌든. 여기 수고비야." <<he>>【이가】 돈뭉치를 건네준다. 당신은 <<moneyGain 150>>【을를】 얻었다.
<br><br>

"주인장에게 인사를 좀 하러 가야겠군." <<he>>【이가】 걸어가며 말한다. "서류 작업을 마친 뒤에 말이야."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Superintendent Nod
<<effects>>

"내 사무실은 입구 근처에 있어." <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 말한다. "잘 가."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Knock Intro
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
당신은 문을 두드렸다. 반대편에서 쿵쿵거리는 발소리가 들리더니, 문이 활짝 열리며 조끼와 청바지를 입은 <<person>>【이가】 모습을 드러낸다.
<br><br>

<<his>> 시선이 당신의 몸을 한 번 훑고 지나간다. "무슨 일이지?"
<br><br>

<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[일거리를 묻는다 (1:00)|Flats Knock Intro 2]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[주소를 잘못 찾았다고 말하고 떠난다|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Flats Knock Intro 2
<<effects>><<wearProp "rag">>

"욕실 청소가 필요해." 문을 완전히 열며 <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "오른쪽 첫 번째 문이다. 청소 도구는 선반 위에 있을 거다."
<br><br>
욕실에 들어갔다. 제법 깨끗하지만 욕조가 얼룩져 있다. 선반 위에는 걸레 하나와 함께 여러 개의 병이 놓여 있다. 걸레 역시 거의 새것처럼 깨끗하다. 병들을 돌려보았지만, 아무런 상표도 적혀 있지 않다.

<<if currentSkillValue('housekeeping') gte 100>>
	<<set $flats_progress to 1>>
	가장 가까운 병을 열어본다. 뚜껑이 꽉 끼어 열리지 않지만, 걸레를 덧대어 힘을 주자 마침내 비틀어 열린다.
	<br><br>
	욕조 표면에 세척액을 붓고, 화학 약품이 스며드는 동안 선반과 창턱의 먼지를 닦아낸다. 수돗물을 틀고 샤워기를 사용해 에나멜 표면을 씻어 내린다. 화학 약품이 씻겨 내려가며 진주빛 흰색이 드러난다.
	<br><br>
	당신이 청소를 마칠 때쯤 <<person>>【이가】 들어온다. <span class="green">"나쁘지 않군."</span> <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "여기 돈 받아. 다른 주민들도 네 솜씨 좋은 손길을 필요로 할 거다." 당신은 <<printmoney 1000>><<money 1000 "flatsCleaning">>【을를】 벌었다.
	<br><br>
	"잠깐," 당신이 집을 나서려 할 때 <<he>>【이가】 불러 세운다. "아파트 중 한 곳에 연꽃 모양의 문고리가 달려 있어. <span class="purple">그곳엔 가까이 가지 마.</span> 너 같이 착한 <<girl>>【이가】 엮일 만한 부류의 사람들이 아니니까."
	<br><br>
	<i>이제 바브 가의 아파트에서 청소부로 일할 수 있습니다.</i>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	병 하나를 열어보려 했지만 뚜껑이 꽉 끼어 열리지 않는다. 다음 병은 운 좋게 열었지만, 이게 청소용 화학 약품인지 확신할 수 없다.
	<br><br>
	욕조에 용액을 붓고 몇 분 기다린 뒤 물을 튼다. 물은 맑아졌지만 얼룩은 그대로 남아 있다. 차례대로 병을 시도해 보지만 얼룩은 전혀 지워지지 않는다. 걸레로 욕조를 박박 문질러 보아도 소용이 없다. 이제 병이 하나밖에 남지 않았다.
	<br><br>
	뚜껑을 있는 힘껏 비튼다. 뚜껑이 헐거워졌지만 <span class="red">힘을 너무 과하게 줬다.</span> 병이 손에서 튕겨 나가며 안에 든 용액이 욕조로 쏟아진다. 병을 똑바로 세웠을 땐 이미 절반이나 비어버린 후였다.
	<br><br>
	그 광경을 목격한 <<person>>【이가】 안으로 들어온다. "젠장," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "내가 씨발 간단한 걸 시켰—" <<he>>【은는】 말을 멈추고 숨을 들이마신다. "됐어. 돈은 안 줄 거다. 나가."
	<br><br>
	<span class="blue">아파트에서 청소부로 일하려면 가사 기술이 최소 <span class="pink">F+</span> 등급은 되어야 합니다.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

